# the white keys play the Lead in the scale (key i: degree i from the root up, in its register): the first piece,
# Timewind, D Aeolian, the fourth white key (w3, key 6): degree 3, G4 (67); its key lit while it sounds; the black keys
# do nothing; the scale is never changed from the keys (D Aeolian: 0 2 3 5 7 8 10 from the root, 1453)
wait 500
expect pool 1453
key w3 down
wait 300
expect lastnote_ch3 67
expect litkey6 1
key w3 up
wait 300
expect litkey6 0
# (the user) in play the black keys stay lit, apart from the white ones: the effects there; one goes dark while held;
# a white key unlit until played
expect litkey1 1
expect litkey13 1
expect litkey25 1
expect litkey0 0
key b1 down
wait 300
expect litkey3 0
expect litkey1 1
key b1 up
wait 300
expect litkey3 1
expect pool 1453
